<title>UK: IPE Brent falls under $18 to new nine-month low.</title>
<headline>IPE Brent falls under $18 to new nine-month low.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>IPE prompt May Brent futures fell to a new nine-month low of $17.90 a barrel on Friday after breaking what traders said was technical support at $18.</p>
</text>
